Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.82,0:01:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't drink this stuff you\Nhave no tolerance for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's disrespectful to the\Nbooze to drink it like that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.94,0:02:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hooch's brand name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.66,0:02:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, we did everything we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.08,0:02:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to stop beating yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.10,0:02:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have to call it\Nsomething, call it destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.94,0:02:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try to justify it by\Nlabeling it with a simple word.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many died, and they\Nwon't be coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.68,0:02:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more than I can bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.60,0:02:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.24,0:02:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I killed Brad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.48,0:02:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash, it wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.66,0:03:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there was nothing you\Ncould have done to save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.24,0:03:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.58,0:03:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone who touches me ends up dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.10,0:03:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That very well may be, but there's\Nnothing you can do about it at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've still got somewhere\Nelse you have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.36,0:03:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.26,0:03:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.17,0:03:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes, I have to face him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, there it is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.84,0:03:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here! It's about time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.88,0:03:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay, team!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.34,0:03:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have a pudding olive\Noil and a mocha frosty cream
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:04:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I correct in assuming\Nthat means you're hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.98,0:04:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mason, how could you tell, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.84,0:04:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolfwood?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.75,0:04:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know absolutely\Neverything about you, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.30,0:04:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, forget it, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.72,0:04:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid Stryfe are out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice comeback? Ahah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Meryl? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, um... nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.64,0:04:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.55,0:04:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is anybody in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where poor, unfortunate, hungry\Ntravelers aimlessly wandering the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.85,0:04:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would it be alright if we came inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you in for three hundred thousand\Ndouble dollar three hundred thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.45,0:04:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said it cuz I know you don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my little way of saying\Nyou're not welcome here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.92,0:04:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the sudden hostility?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't mean you any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.79,0:04:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's not like we're dangerous or\Nanything I'm Meryl Stryfe from
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.18,0:05:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Bernardelli I don't care if\Nyou're from Bernardelli or the feds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.82,0:05:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My answer is final.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.16,0:05:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.28,0:05:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.19,0:05:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're not being\Nvery fair about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.36,0:05:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come they don't want us and\Nwe have to respect them the people
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.18,0:05:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of this town probably have a\Ngood reason it's not just a whim!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he's just leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't he over it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.62,0:05:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.64,0:05:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.54,0:05:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.00,0:05:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, aren't you going to\Nsay thank you to the nice man?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.14,0:05:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say thank you. Come on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.54,0:05:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that was easy, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.98,0:05:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:05:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.39,0:05:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only desert that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:05:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.81,0:06:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we need to take\Na little side trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit standing around wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.67,0:06:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anybody home?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.00,0:06:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.82,0:06:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Stop it! We're not mad at you! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.90,0:06:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just got turned away\Nfrom that town, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we just want to stay\Nhere for a little while!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.98,0:06:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, we won't hurt you, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.92,0:06:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, just listen to me,\NI'm not asking for a favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, you want a trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull that away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess this means we have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.12,0:06:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolfwood, those were\Nour emergency rations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.84,0:06:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would agree with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.24,0:06:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is definitely an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:06:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.20,0:07:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know, apparently\NI seem to be outnumbered this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.34,0:07:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.76,0:07:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie, what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.69,0:07:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want some, too, Meryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.62,0:07:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're really tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.53,0:07:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So these kids are all orphans, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.55,0:07:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really just a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happened by chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.58,0:07:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all ended up gathering\Nhere in the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.56,0:07:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's unusual, but that sort of\Nthing has been known to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys have been a great help, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.66,0:07:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't have much to eat and\Nyou came in a really good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No big deal, just lending a helping hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I was just wondering, why is it\Nthey won't let you into the town?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.94,0:07:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't let any outsiders in,\Neven if they're only children.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.34,0:07:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The townsfolk are frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.84,0:07:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.28,0:07:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.34,0:07:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I do know that every town in\Nthis region has been abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, except for Key Bass over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.78,0:07:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My town was abandoned too the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.88,0:07:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day, without warning,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.12,0:08:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone just stopped what they\Nwere doing, and they began to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't take a thing with them, and\Nthey didn't say a word as they laughed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad! Dad! What's wrong? What's the\Nmatter? Say something! What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you all doing? Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom! Mom! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all just left home, walked out\Nof town like they were blind and dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.48,0:08:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They looked like zombies, like\Nsomething was controlling them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.82,0:08:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the others went through\Nthe same thing with their parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all left at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.92,0:08:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.86,0:08:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During the time this was happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did you see anyone other\Nthan the townsfolk there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.20,0:08:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But actually, I did hear a strange voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.23,0:08:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't understand what it\Nhad to do with them leaving home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.44,0:08:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It said this is what you\Nget for taking so long
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.56,0:09:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, he never does get a\Nbreak, does he? Poor sub so
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.60,0:09:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are you gonna do now\Nthat you're going in or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.16,0:09:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No kid is ever going to warm up\Nto a guy with an empty smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you guys hand that up to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.26,0:09:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be happy to carry it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.22,0:09:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say something\Nabout kids warming up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.40,0:09:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that these guys\Nare a little shy, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two are so good, you're\Ngreat at helping out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.04,0:09:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if you cut it with a\Nknife along the tendon at a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.76,0:09:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right angle like this and\Nsprinkle on a lot of pepper,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.36,0:09:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll actually last a lot\Nlonger than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.78,0:09:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And guess what, it'll taste better, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.98,0:09:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Women are a marvel, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.32,0:10:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, what you cooking, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our secret until supper time. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, how could you be so cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.72,0:10:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy, he is nothing but trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dig in, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.66,0:10:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.04,0:10:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.92,0:10:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.36,0:10:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of wiggly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.58,0:10:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ain't bad either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it, I give it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they're all fast asleep at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.66,0:10:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing it's a long time\Nsince they were able to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.44,0:10:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at those happy faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.68,0:10:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.16,0:10:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.12,0:11:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I take too long,\Nthey'll make another move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still we can't just leave these kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.86,0:11:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit being so serious\Nand cheer up! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.72,0:11:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.72,0:11:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.56,0:11:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard a gun go off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.92,0:11:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.83,0:11:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.75,0:11:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.76,0:12:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone get away from the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they shooting him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said get away from the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.10,0:12:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone will hang here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.84,0:12:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.48,0:12:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know you're in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.98,0:12:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you aren't out here by the time it\Ncomes to ten, we're coming in after you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.48,0:12:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we will shoot to kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.90,0:12:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way out of this\Nmisunderstanding is to reason with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.58,0:12:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reason with those hotheads?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.90,0:12:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.81,0:13:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you come up with\Nanything better than that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.22,0:13:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind, I'll go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.76,0:13:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two, one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.40,0:13:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, we're not exactly sure what we did\Nto upset you fellas, we meant no harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind filling us in a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just pretending to be nice to these\Nkids for camouflage, you piece of trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.66,0:13:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't buy you crap for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.10,0:13:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, but I have no\Nidea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.06,0:13:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb with us, spiky boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you and your pals are the only\Noutsiders anywhere near town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.80,0:13:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is a false alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.06,0:13:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.58,0:13:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all some kind of terrible mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.88,0:13:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, you're a real Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice Guy, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.90,0:13:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeffrey was killed and\Nhe was my best friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.48,0:14:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid bunch of blundering ignoramuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.16,0:14:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give the goody-goody routine\Na rest, will you, Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, just listen to\Nwhat we have to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.28,0:14:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You worthless piece of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.62,0:14:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.74,0:14:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, easy, easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.28,0:14:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weather's still in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would they...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.84,0:14:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, isn't this entire\Narea made up of solid dead rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.18,0:14:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.09,0:14:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only way they\Ncan build a house on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.02,0:14:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beats the heck out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.64,0:14:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one thing for sure, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.74,0:14:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not safe here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.68,0:14:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll divert their attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two get the kids out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.96,0:14:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.74,0:14:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will let us into your town, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that takes care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.78,0:15:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for us to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.50,0:15:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, good luck. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.26,0:15:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.14,0:15:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.86,0:15:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.76,0:15:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I kill those either?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't kill those, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.84,0:15:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.75,0:15:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We always have to do everything your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty well organized\Nfor ordinary sandworms.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.00,0:15:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.10,0:15:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's out there, some...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.38,0:15:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some rotten lowlife must be sitting back\Nwatching as they do his dirty work for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:16:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you suppose...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.06,0:16:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did the worms get inside the town?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.28,0:16:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try the building, hurry! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you climb high enough, the\Nworms won't be able to get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.60,0:16:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.18,0:16:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm sorry! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.02,0:16:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our whole town's destroyed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.18,0:16:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Milly and the boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.92,0:16:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.18,0:16:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're over with Wolfwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.20,0:17:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they'll be all right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.28,0:17:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what is this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.18,0:17:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep having this strange sensation\Nlike something is out of place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.58,0:17:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too many of them here
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.64,0:17:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I caught you fair and square, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.84,0:17:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right. There's\Nnothing to be ashamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.18,0:18:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.50,0:18:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.30,0:18:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.24,0:19:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were using a high-frequency\Ndevice to control them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.20,0:19:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're your own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.36,0:19:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you want to hurt them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because they're not my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.48,0:19:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I am a gung-ho gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.06,0:19:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the fourth of the gung-ho guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.46,0:19:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Zazie the Beast. You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.96,0:19:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, that is so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.82,0:19:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This confirms why I hate children.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.32,0:19:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They whine, they get depressed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.44,0:19:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they'll only brush\Ntheir teeth when they're
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,told because they're too\Nstupid to do otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.90,0:19:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They completely lack any\Nconcept of free will!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.32,0:19:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You probably aren't even capable\Nof comprehending why I would
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Choose to do something this\Ninteresting. Stop it. No. Hey, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.94,0:19:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you doing babe my name is
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:20:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zazie it's Zazie the Beast you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.16,0:20:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know this isn't who you really\Nare huh it's true I Saw you crying
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.44,0:20:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the other night the demon hasn't\Nwon at one point you even tried
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To cheer me on in spite of him,\Nwell that's where you're wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.60,0:20:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,demons can block their\Nconsciousness And memory on demand I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.62,0:20:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't believe that you want it\Nthis way you're forcing yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.22,0:20:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goody two shoes idiot you don't know who\NI am that's fine believe whatever you want
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.78,0:20:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could just die thinking your pleasant\Nlittle thoughts stop this beat right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, Wolfwood?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.10,0:21:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't have to end like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.58,0:21:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kids are kids, and that's one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.26,0:21:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was no kid, he was\Nnothing but a damn demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.28,0:21:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I hadn't shot him,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.12,0:21:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that would have been you lying there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.84,0:21:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.22,0:21:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wasn't going to shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saved your ass yet one more time and you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come after me with your childish bullshit?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.10,0:21:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.86,0:21:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.00,0:21:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What other alternative do I\Nhave if we're going to survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.36,0:21:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're searching for a place\Nwhere we can live peaceful days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.62,0:21:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With no wars and no stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.86,0:22:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A place that isn't run by fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.98,0:22:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A place where people can live and\Nactually trust other human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.90,0:22:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.44,0:22:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need to hear your\Nidealistic dreams right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.68,0:22:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.14,0:24:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To realize a mistake.\NTo not lie. To love one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.82,0:24:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,another to not kill those\Nare very simple things!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.24,0:24:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but these times won't\Nallow for them there is
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.38,0:24:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no green on this planet\Neven though we want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.24,0:24:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and won it so badly a place where we can
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.22,0:24:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,live peaceful days with\Nno wars nor stealing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.96,0:24:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sacred place where\Npeople can live as people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.28,0:24:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.52,0:24:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That place is called.

